    [Doc][Misc] Remove Huawei references and update contact instructions in documentation (#18719)
    
    ### What this PR does / why we need it?
    
    This pull request updates the documentation and translation files to
    remove specific references to "Huawei" (e.g., changing "Huawei HiDevLab"
    to "HiDevLab", "Huawei NPU" to "NPU", "Huawei OBS" to "OBS").
    Additionally, it updates the instructions for obtaining prebuilt images
    in the Gemma4 tutorial, changing "contact Huawei engineers" to "please
    submit an ISSUE".
    Feedback has been provided regarding a double space issue in the msgid
    concatenation within using_volcano_kthena.po which would cause a
    mismatch with the source text and prevent the translation from being
    applied.
    
    ### Does this PR introduce _any_ user-facing change?
    
    No, this PR only updates documentation and translations.
    
    ### How was this patch tested?
    
    Documentation-only updates. No code testing is required.
    
    - vLLM main:
    https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/commit/c4df37dfcc7f72ca41cd43801a468526ecf99a2b
    
    Signed-off-by: x60087760 <xiechangxiu3@h-partners.com>
    Co-authored-by: x60087760 <xiechangxiu3@h-partners.com>

